# EmailJS Configuration for Email Notifications
# Get these values from https://www.emailjs.com/

# 1. Service ID - From "Email Services" section
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx

# 2. Welcome Email Template ID - From "Email Templates" section (for new user registration)
VITE_EMAILJS_WELCOME_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx

# 3. OTP Email Template ID - From "Email Templates" section (for password reset)
VITE_EMAILJS_OTP_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx

# 4. Public Key - From "Account" → "General" section
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Instructions:
# 1. Go to https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Create account and add Gmail service
# 3. Create TWO email templates:
#    - Welcome Email (for new registrations)
#    - OTP Email (for password reset) - HTML from EMAILJS_SETUP_GUIDE.md
# 4. Copy your Service ID, both Template IDs, and Public Key
# 5. Replace the xxxxxxx values above with your actual credentials
# 6. Save this file
# 7. Restart your frontend server: npm run dev
